  ## 4\. The 4 Agentic Patterns — Architect Edition
  
  ## Pattern 1: Reflection
  
  ## (Quality Control Pattern)
  
  ![](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:461/0*oCq337QQs0XFXhva.png)
  
  Press enter or click to view image in full size
  
  ![](https://miro.medium.com/v2/resize:fit:700/0*gtbDA97BLWtwrlfu.png)
  
  ## Architectural Purpose
  
  Reflection is **not for intelligence**.
  
  It is for **risk reduction**.
  
