  ## When Architects MUST Use It
  
  - Code generation
  - Legal / compliance text
  - RAG answers
  - Financial logic
  
  ## When NOT to Use It
  
  - Real-time latency paths
  - Deterministic pipelines
  
  ## Enterprise Pattern
  
  > **_Reflection = Internal QA agent_**
  
